SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 1

RATES
Calcite_kinetic
-start
10 REM Calcite dissolution rate, simple linear rate law
20 rate = 10 * SA * (1)
30 moles = rate * TIME
40 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_kinetic
        -m0 1
        -steps 10 in 100 steps
        -step_divide 1
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -parms 1.0

SURFACE 1
    -equilibrate with solution 1

PRINT
    -reset false

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file witherite_sel.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -si Witherite
